t': 'Sprich die Brennenden Winde nur, nachdem Du angegriffen wurdest, und bevor Du die Blocker deklarierst. Die Brennenden Winde fügen jeder angreifenden Kreatur 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48e9996e-9e10-401d-ab65-3a3821d050bc'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vientos abrasadores', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8cc99fc9-8e9d-4fd0-aef8-4ab8bfbf7ac8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vent torride', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb0dbae8-cfc9-466d-9e65-432de85a4ea0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '灼熱の風', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bf3a549e-ee42-4209-9885-5f4ea3fa935e'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Brennender Speer', 'text': 'Der Brennende Speer fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler Deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9bcb587-53af-4ed5-ac8e-42dbdee48f23'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Lanza abrasadora', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7709005-ffba-440d-ad96-a18e3296a155'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Lance ardente', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '392d37bf-203e-4d2d-a3db-ecb035173501'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '焦熱の槍', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33b46734-f07d-406a-821a-d3aa0e1676f8'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Buckelwurm', 'type': 'Beschwörungszauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba9ece94-8ca5-4546-8f9a-c83d7710e931'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sierpe de púas', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cdaea83-c081-4b73-85fb-6edbc708e57c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Guivre à piquants', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'sc