legt sie auf seinen Friedhof.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20c05a90-af2d-45ba-87c3-da0f69f032ce'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Constricción mística', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fde1a27-527e-48fa-8963-3eab75157da3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Denis mystique', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e7d0aea-28d7-4720-8ba4-22541d1debc8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '否定の秘術', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8a9e291-8a93-40a2-8f47-d84624f56917'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Genialer Einfall', 'text': 'Ziehe zwei Karten.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2780848c-5e25-431d-8812-10aeaf322bda'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Toque de genio', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8cca9cb4-9c93-4e19-aaf1-7d4eed5d6e90'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Toucher de miroitement', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d716b59-19d4-4b7a-b64e-317dc926d7c8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '一瞬の才気', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '472abeec-c9ae-46fc-8cb2-813747457849'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Gepanzerter Pegasus', 'text': 'Fliegend', 'type': 'Beschwörungszauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f07b1a1a-7e05-4c09-9aff-121a2fc6af8f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Pegaso acorazado', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9107da67-3abe-4ef7-8046-6e3c4a842bda'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Pégase cuirassé', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f52c47e5-defd-4275-89ae-e9bfd1951bca'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '鎧のペガサス', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0d5ab1e-3768-404d-8edb-748dce03714c'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Gestrenger Marschall', 'text': 'Du kannst den Gestrengen Marschall in Deinem Zug, bevor Du angreifst, tappen, um einer Kreatur Deiner Wahl +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges zu geben.', 'type': 'Beschwörungszauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f50c0f87-9982-441e-b96a-bd753966a2ee'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Mariscal severo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ecac9df1-3493-4f09-b6da-61494c0ff3dc'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Maréchal rigoureux', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd1fffcb-754b-4598-8d99-e37950e56591'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '厳格な司令官', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f446c11-93ea-402a-a18b-639d1340549c'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Geweihter Ritter', 'text': 'Der Geweihte Ritter kann nicht von schwarzen oder roten Kreaturen geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Beschwörungszauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1dccf4e9-d42c-466c-a225-0ff79b96810b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Caballero sagrado', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd71b05bd-91e8-4251-aae6-a84d7bd23618'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Chevalier sacre', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fda1bdc1-0de9-48e6-9694-dca7375bd56a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '聖なる騎士', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4457e2e5-4c96-4707-ace3-ff902b85601a'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Gleichgewicht der Kräfte', 'text': 'Wenn Du weniger Karten als Dein Gegner auf der Hand hast, ziehe soviele Karten, bis ihr die gleiche Anzahl an Karten auf der Hand habt.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ffd1d311-0e54-4a0c-995d-ad59b5579ae9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Equilibrio de poder', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e4e29ba-496e-4c80-9086-796a6a1633d5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Équilibre du pouvoir', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b90a77e-c6c0-4f1a-aa79-9c20a49307a1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '力の均衡', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '865ed863-5347-45a2-8102-4abe38003b45'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Goblintyrann', 'type': 'Beschwörungszauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52157233-ffa5-45b8-8e31-4514cd4e6881'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Trasgo bravucón', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3176aec2-4aec-4322-aec4-7e06cb012169'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Gobelin bravache', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40489324-4edf-4125-9779-a97f88cf83a2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ごろつきゴブリン', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d65bcad-1052-450d-b985-85a01c824c01'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Gorillakrieger', 'type': 'Beschwörungszauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3c99bb3-e2e7-4372-8a21-2a5d50c50b41'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Guerrero gorila', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f03e8ff-b5a1-48b5-8569-1dc28c7097de'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Guerrier gorille', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '219af268-22fa-4434-836d-cbf5bb22d475'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ゴリラの戦士', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2aa42f73-fbc0-4578-99f2-3a024e5c0712'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Granitmauer', 'text': 'Die Granitmauer kann nicht angreifen.', 'type': 'Beschwörungszauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04c00088-126c-443a-8306-4e78ba70a90d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Muro de granito', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06fc9c6a-633d-4873-82c4-3b9af973059e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Mur de granit', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea0b11ce-9ba3-4c3f-b55a-5c60d73dd530'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '花崗岩の壁', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6576fa16-8986-45fe-8eba-84c6c1f98373'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Grausame Gerechtigkeit', 'text': 'Sprich die Grausame Gerechtigkeit nur, nachdem Du angegriffen wurdest, und bevor Du die Blocker deklarierst.\\nJede angreifende Kreatur, die Dir Schaden zufügt, fügt in diesem Zug auch dem angreifenden Spieler gleichen Schaden zu.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2bfda9fb-9ac8-4e8f-aacb-6698ffbdbc4b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Justicia implacable', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5dbd4476-1f0f-473a-92fb-0611c6ce449d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Justice féroce', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d587633-f92c-44fa-800b-1b7bb95e51de'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '過酷な裁き', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a6e7bf20-29c8-4a04-afdc-c985c48a92d9'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Grausamer Lehrmeister', 'text': 'Durchsuche Deine Bibliothek nach einer beliebigen Karte. Mische Deine Bibliothek danach und lege die gesuchte Karte oben auf Deine Bibliothek. Du verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2232f0f-e35b-4999-a7e0-32d307aab1f8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Tutor cruel', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'accc2a42-c30c-447f-bdba-95b07bb334a1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Precepteur cruel', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b386cc3a-26b1-45a2-a314-4a71df26fb7b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '残酷な教示者', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edfedf9f-aaaf-409f-91da-f929f97dbd6f'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Grausames Angebot', 'text': 'Ziehe vier Karten. Du verlierst die Hälfte Deiner Lebenspunkte (aufgerundet).', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93828b6b-b30e-4647-9879-6c0a2f3d6198'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Trato cruel', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f4da328-bf88-401f-b7e6-800b98e7ab70'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Marche cruel', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f86f02f8-1ddb-4889-a46a-b76e1a9c0e99'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '残酷な取り引き', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5215a85-2ac0-4aa3-8fdd-9ba84936527f'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Grausames Schicksal', 'text': 'Schaue Dir die obersten fünf Karten der Bibliothek Deines Gegners an. Lege eine Karte davon auf seinen Friedhof und die übrigen in beliebiger Reihenfolge wieder auf seine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36d4e8be-5ff2-4ac7-8c2d-86aa2fa63fd0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Destino Cruel', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd71b3d3-2a5c-4121-9dfa-8dda49db43c1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cruel destin', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4bca62a-39a7-4838-a691-3e4c451a2c67'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '残酷な運命', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '590021fe-af9c-4b82-ad5d-0b5eb012316f'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Grenzwächter', 'type': 'Beschwörungszauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c1f96e3-5165-4c99-95