original_text: ["All white creatures get +2/+0 until the end of the turn. (This includes other players' white creatures.)", 'All your creatures get +0/+3 until the end of the turn.', 'All your creatures get +1/+1 until the end of the turn.', 'All your creatures get +1/+1 until the end of the turn. (For example, a 1/2 creature would become 2/3.)', 'All your green creatures gain forestwalk until the end of the turn. (If defending player has any forests in play, none of your green creatures can be intercepted.)', 'Any one creature gains flying until the end of the turn. You draw a card.', 'Any one creature gets +2/+0 until the end of the turn.\\nBurning Cloak deals 2 damage to that creature.', 'Any one creature gets +3/+3 and gains flying until the end of the turn.', 'Any one creature gets +4/+0 until the end of the turn.', 'Any one creature gets +4/+4 until the end of the turn.', 'Any one creature gets +4/+4 until the end of the turn. (For example, a 6/3 creature would become 10/7.)', "At the beginning of your opponent's next turn, he or she skips untapping his or her creatures and lands.", "Attacking doesn't cause Ardent Militia to tap.", 'B', 'Bee Sting deals 2 damage to any one creature or player.', 'Blaze deals X damage to any one creature or player.', 'Blaze deals X damage to any one creature or player. (For example, if you tap a mountain plus four other lands when you play Blaze, it deals 4 damage.)', "Charging Rhino can't be intercepted by more than one creature.", 'Choose any one creature. This turn, all creatures able to intercept that creature do so.', "Choose any one player. On that player's next turn, all his or her creatures that can attack you must do so.", "Choose any one player. That player can't attack on his or her next turn.", "Choose one of your creatures. Final Strike deals to your opponent damage equal to that creature's offense. Then, put the creature in your discard pile.", "Craven Giant can't intercept.", "Craven Knight can't intercept.", 'Deep-Sea Serpent can attack only if the defending player has an island in play.', 'Destroy all creatures and lands. (This includes your creatures and lands.)', 'Destroy all green creatures. (This includes your green creatures.)', 'Destroy all islands. (This includes your islands.)', 'Destroy all lands. (This includes your lands.)', 'Destroy all plains. (This includes your plains.)', 'Destroy all white creatures. (This includes your white creatures.)', 'Destroy any one creature or land.', "Destroy any one creature that isn't black.", "Destroy any one creature that isn't black. (A creature is black if it has o\\nB in its cost.)", "Destroy any one creature. That creature's owner gains 4 life.", 'Destroy any one land.', 'Destroy any one tapped creature.', "Destroy any two creatures that aren't black. You lose 5 life. (You can't play Wicked Pact unless you can choose two creatures to destroy.)", 'Destroy any two lands.', 'Draw four cards. You lose half your life, rounded up. (For example, if you have 11 life, you lose 6 life.)', 'Draw two cards.', 'Dry Spell deals 1 damage to each creature and player. (This includes your creatures and you.)', 'Each player chooses and discards from his or her hand any number of cards and then draws that many cards. You then draw a card. (You choose first.)', "Each player counts the cards in his or her hand, shuffles those cards into his or her deck, and then draws that many cards. (When you play Winds of Change, it doesn't count as a card in your hand.)", 'Each player draws X cards.', 'Each player may draw up to two cards. For each card less than two any player draws, that player gains 2 life. (You choose whether to draw first.)', 'Earthquake deals X damage to each player and each creature without flying. (This includes you and your creatures without flying.)', 'Fire Tempest deals 6 damage to each creature and player. (This includes your creatures and you. If all players drop to 0 life or less, the game is a draw.)', "Fleet-Footed Monk can't be intercepted by any creature with offense 2 or greater.", 'Flying', "Flying\\nAttacking doesn't cause Archangel to tap.", 'Flying\\nCloud Dragon can intercept only creatures with flying.', 'Flying\\nCloud Pirates can intercept only creatures with flying.', 'Flying\\nCloud Spirit can intercept only creatures with flying.', 'Flying\\nIf Alabaster Dragon is put into your discard pile from play, shuffle Alabaster Dragon back into your deck.', 'Flying\\nVolcanic Dragon is unaffected by summoning sickness.', "Flying\\nWall of Swords can't attack.", 'Flying\\nWhen Dread Reaper comes into play from your hand, you lose 5 life. (The person who plays Dread Reaper loses the life.)', 'Flying\\nWhen Ebon Dragon comes into play from your hand, you may force your opponent to choose and discard a card from his or her hand.', 'Flying\\nWhen Fire Dragon comes into play from your hand, it deals to any one creature damage equal to the number of mountains you have in play.', "Flying\\nWhen Ingenious Thief comes into play from your hand, look at your opponent's hand.", 'Flying\\nWhen Owl Familiar comes into play from your hand, draw a card, then choose and discard a card from your hand.', 'For each black creature your opponent has in play, you gain 3 life.', 'For each forest you and your opponent have in play, you gain 1 life.', 'For each mountain your opponent has in play, you gain 2 life.', 'For each tapped creature your opponent has in play, you draw a card.', "Forestwalk (If defending player has any forests in play, Elite Cat Warrior can't be intercepted. Forests are in play regardless of whether they're tapped or untapped.)", "Forestwalk (If defending player has any forests in play, Elite Cat Warrior can't be intercepted.)", "Forestwalk (If defending player has any forests in play, Willow Dryad can't be intercepted.)", 'Forked Lightning deals 4 damage divided any way you choose among any one, two, or three creatures.', 'G', 'Giant Spider can intercept as though it had flying.', "Hulking Cyclops can't intercept.", "Hulking Goblin can't intercept.", 'Hurricane deals X damage to each player and each creature with flying. (This includes you and your creatures with flying.)', 'If Charging Bandits attacks, it gets +2/+0 until the end of the turn.', 'If Charging Paladin attacks, it gets +0/+3 until the end of the turn.', 'If Endless Cockroaches is put into your discard pile from play, return Endless Cockroaches to your hand.', 'If Fire Snake is put into your discard pile from play, destroy any one land.', 'If Noxious Toad is put into your discard pile from play, your opponent chooses and discards a card from his or her hand.', "If Seasoned Marshal attacks, you may choose to tap any one creature. (Tapped creatures can't intercept.)", 'If Thing from the Deep attacks, destroy one of your islands or destroy Thing from the Deep.', 'If Undying Beast is put into your discard pile from play, put Undying Beast on top of your deck.', "If you have fewer cards in your hand than your opponent does, draw until you have the same number. (When you play Balance of Power, it doesn't count as in your hand.)", 'If your opponent has more lands in play than you do, search your deck for up to three plains and put them into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterwards.', "Islandwalk (If defending player has any islands in play, Bull Hippo can't be intercepted.)", "Jungle Lion can't intercept.", 'Keen-Eyed Archers can intercept as though it had flying.', 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to your opponent.', "Look at the top five cards of your opponent's deck. Put one of them into your opponent's discard pile and the rest on top of his or her deck in any order.", 'Look at the top seven cards of your deck. Put two of them into your hand and the rest into your discard pile.', 'Look at the top three cards of your deck and return them in any order. You may choose to shuffle your deck. Then draw a card.', "Look at your opponent's hand. For each forest and green card there, you draw a card. (You draw from your deck.)", "Look at your opponent's hand. For each mountain and red card there, you draw a card. (You draw from your deck.)", "Look at your opponent's hand. You draw a card. (Draw the card from your deck.)", "Mountainwalk (If defending player has any mountains in play, Mountain Goat can't be intercepted.)", 'Needle Storm deals 4 damage to each creature with flying. (This includes your creatures with flying.)', 'On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Capricious Sorcerer to have it deal 1 damage to any one creature or player.', "On your turn, before you attack, you may tap King's Assassin to destroy any one tapped creature.", 'On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Stern Marshal to give any one creature +2/+2 until the end of the turn.', "Phantom Warrior can't be intercepted.", "Play Assassin's Blade only after you're attacked, before you declare interceptors.\\nDestroy any one attacking creature that isn't black.", "Play Blessed Reversal only after you're attacked, before you declare interceptors.\\nFor each attacking creature, you gain 3 life.", "Play Command of Unsummoning only after you're attacked, before you declare interceptors.\\nReturn any one or two attacking creatures to their owner's hand.", "Play Deep Wood only after you're attacked, before you declare interceptors.\\nThis turn, all damage dealt to you by attacking creatures is reduced to 0.", "Play Defiant Stand only after you're attacked, before you declare interceptors.\\nAny one creature gets +1/+3 until the end of the turn. If that creature is tapped, untap it.", "Play Harsh Justice only after you're attacked, before you declare interceptors.\\nThis turn, each attacking creature that damages you also deals equal damage to the attacking player.", 'Play Mystic Denial only in response to another player playing a summon creature or a sorcery. That card has no effect, and that player puts it into his or her discard pile.', "Play Scorching Winds only after you're attacked, before you declare interceptors.\\nScorching Winds deals 1 damage to each attacking creature.", "Play Treetop Defense only after you're attacked, before you declare interceptors.\\nThis turn, all your creatures can intercept as though they had flying.", "Put all creatures into their owners' discard piles. (This includes your creatures.)", 'Pyroclasm deals 2 damage to each creature. (This includes your creatures.)', 'R', 'Raging Cougar is unaffected by summoning sickness.', 'Raging Goblin is unaffected by summoning sickness.', 'Raging Goblin is unaffected by summoning sickness. (It can attack the turn you play it, unless another card prevents this.)', 'Raging Minotaur is unaffected by summoning sickness.', 'Return any one card from your discard pile to your hand.', "Return any one creature to its owner's hand. You draw a card.", "Return any one creature to the top of its owner's deck.", 'Return any one sorcery card from your discard pile to your hand.', 'Return any one summon creature from your discard pile to your hand.', "Sacred Knight can't be intercepted by black or red creatures.", 'Scorching Spear deals 1 damage to any one creature or player.', 'Search your deck for a forest and put that card into play. Shuffle your deck afterwards.', 'Search your deck for a green summon creature and put that card into play. Treat it as though you just played it from your hand. Then put one of your green creatures into your discard pile. Shuffle your deck afterwards.', 'Search your deck for a plains, island, swamp, mountain, or forest and put that card into play. Shuffle your deck afterwards.', 'Search your deck for a sorcery and reveal that card to all players. Shuffle your deck and put the revealed card on top of it.', 'Search your deck for a summon creature and reveal that card to all players. Then shuffle your deck and put the revealed card on top of it.', 'Search your deck for any card. Shuffle your deck and put that card on top of it. You lose 2 life.', "Soul Shred deals 3 damage to any one creature that isn't black. You gain 3 life.", 'Spitting Earth deals to any one creature damage equal to the number of mountains you have in play. (This includes both tapped and untapped mountains.)', "Stalking Tiger can't be intercepted by more than one creature.", "Swampwalk (If defending player has any swamps in play, Anaconda can't be intercepted. Swamps are in play regardless of whether they're tapped or untapped.)", "Swampwalk (If defending player has any swamps in play, Anaconda can't be intercepted.)", "Swampwalk (If defending player has any swamps in play, Bog Raiders can't be intercepted.)", "Swampwalk (If defending player has any swamps in play, Bog Wraith can't be intercepted.)", "Take another turn after this one. You lose the game at the end of that turn. (You don't lose if you've already won.)", 'Take any one summon creature from your discard pile and put that card into play. Treat it as though you just played it from your hand.', 'Take up to three lands from your hand and put them into play.', 'Tap all creatures except for white creatures. (This includes your creatures.)', "Tap any one, two, or three creatures without flying. (Tapped creatures can't intercept.)", 'This turn, your black creatures can be intercepted only by other black creatures.', 'Thundermare is unaffected by summoning sickness.\\nWhen Thundermare comes into play from your hand, tap all other creatures. (This includes your creatures.)', 'U', 'Untap all your creatures.', 'Vampiric Feast deals 4 damage to any one creature or player. You gain 4 life.', 'Vampiric Touch deals 2 damage to your opponent. You gain 2 life.', 'Volcanic Hammer deals 3 damage to any one creature or player.', 'W', "Wall of Granite can't attack.", "When Fire Imp comes into play from your hand, it deals 2 damage to any one creature. (If you're the only player with creatures, Fire Imp deals 2 damage to one of your creatures.)", 'When Gravedigger comes into play from your hand, you may choose to return a summon creature from your discard pile to your hand.', "When Man-o'-War comes into play from your hand, return any one creature to its owner's hand. (If you're the only one with creatures, return one of them to your hand.)", 'When Mercenary Knight comes into play from your hand, choose and discard a summon creature from your hand or destroy Mercenary Knight.', 'When Pillaging Horde comes into play from your hand, discard a card at random from your hand or destroy Pillaging Horde.', 'When Plant Elemental comes into play from your hand, destroy one of your forests or destroy Plant Elemental.', 'When Primeval Force comes into play from your hand, destroy three of your forests or destroy Primeval Force.', "When Serpent Assassin comes into play from your hand, you may choose to destroy any one creature that isn't black.", 'When Serpent Warrior comes into play from your hand, you lose 3 life. (The person who plays Serpent Warrior loses the life.)', 'When Spiritual Guardian comes into play from your hand, you gain 4 life.', 'When Thundering Wurm comes into play from your hand, discard a land from your hand or destroy Thundering Wurm.', 'When Venerable Monk comes into play from your hand, you gain 2 life.', 'When Wood Elves comes into play from your hand, search your deck for a forest and put that card into play. Shuffle your deck afterwards.', 'You gain 4 life.', 'You gain 8 life.', 'Your opponent chooses and discards two cards from his or her hand. (If your opponent has only one card, he or she discards it.)', 'Your opponent discards a card at random from his or her hand.']
original_type: ['Land', 'Sorcery', 'Summon - Creature']
